    {
      "id": "s0112",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Examples¶",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0113",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Note",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0114",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "To use the following examples, you must have the AWS CLI installed and configured. See the [[p0]] in the [[p1]]AWS CLI User Guide[[p2]] for more information.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "Getting started guide"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "<em>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Unless otherwise stated, all examples have unix-like quotation rules. These examples will need to be adapted to your terminal’s quoting rules. See [[p0]] in the [[p1]]AWS CLI User Guide[[p2]] .",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "Using quotation marks with strings"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "<em>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]Example 1: To get the patch state details for an instance[[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The following [[p0]] example retrieves details about the patches for the specified instance.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "describe-instance-patches"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0118",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Output:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0119",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]Example 2: To get a list of patches in the Missing state for an instance[[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The following [[p0]] example retrieves information about patches that are in the Missing state for the specified instance.",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "describe-instance-patches"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Output:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "For more information, see [[p0]] in the [[p1]]AWS Systems Manager User Guide[[p2]].",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "About Patch Compliance States"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "<em>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]Example 3: To get a list of patches installed since a specified InstalledTime for an instance[[p1]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "<strong>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "</strong>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0124",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The following [[p0]] example retrieves information about patches installed since a specified time for the specified instance by combining the use of [[p1]] and [[p2]].",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "describe-instance-patches"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "--filters"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "--query"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0125",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Output:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0126",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Output¶",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0127",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Patches -> (list)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0128",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Each entry in the array is a structure containing:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0129",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Title (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0130",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "KBId (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0131",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Classification (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0132",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Severity (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0133",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "State (string, such as “INSTALLED” or “FAILED”)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0134",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "InstalledTime (DateTime)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0135",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "InstalledBy (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0136",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "(structure)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0137",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Information about the state of a patch on a particular managed node as it relates to the patch baseline used to patch the node.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0138",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Title -> (string) [required]",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0139",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The title of the patch.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0140",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "KBId -> (string) [required]",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0141",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The operating system-specific ID of the patch.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0142",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Classification -> (string) [required]",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0143",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The classification of the patch, such as [[p0]] , [[p1]] , and [[p2]] .",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "SecurityUpdates"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "Updates"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "CriticalUpdates"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0144",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Severity -> (string) [required]",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0145",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The severity of the patch such as [[p0]] , [[p1]] , and [[p2]] .",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "Critical"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "Important"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "Moderate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0146",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "State -> (string) [required]",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0147",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The state of the patch on the managed node, such as INSTALLED or FAILED.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0148",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "For descriptions of each patch state, see [[p0]] in the [[p1]]Amazon Web Services Systems Manager User Guide[[p2]] .",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "About patch compliance"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "<em>"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p2]]",
          "text": "</em>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0149",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Possible values:",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0150",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "INSTALLED"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0151",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "INSTALLED_OTHER"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0152",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "INSTALLED_PENDING_REBOOT"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0153",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "INSTALLED_REJECTED"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0154",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "MISSING"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0155",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "NOT_APPLICABLE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0156",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "FAILED"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0157",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "[[p0]]",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "AVAILABLE_SECURITY_UPDATE"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0158",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "InstalledTime -> (timestamp) [required]",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0159",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The date/time the patch was installed on the managed node. Not all operating systems provide this level of information.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0160",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "CVEIds -> (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0161",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The IDs of one or more Common Vulnerabilities and Exposure (CVE) issues that are resolved by the patch.",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0162",
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Note",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0163",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Currently, CVE ID values are reported only for patches with a status of [[p0]] or [[p1]] .",
      "protected": [
        {
          "token": "[[p0]]",
          "text": "Missing"
        },
        {
          "token": "[[p1]]",
          "text": "Failed"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s0164",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "NextToken -> (string)",
      "protected": []
    },
    {
      "id": "s0165",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "The token to use when requesting the next set of items. If there are no additional items to return, the string is empty.",
      "protected": []
    }
  ]
